            <title>[LU-21021] getxattr("lustre.lov") on an open file returns a stale layout</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21021</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After another client changes a file's layout (a write that makes a mirror stale, a resync), &lt;tt&gt;fgetxattr(fd, "lustre.lov")&lt;/tt&gt; on a file kept open returns the old layout until something else refreshes it, for example a &lt;tt&gt;stat()&lt;/tt&gt;. &lt;tt&gt;llapi_layout_get_by_fd()&lt;/tt&gt; reads the same xattr, so tools that read the layout of an open file act on a mirror state that is no longer true. getxattr by path mostly sees the change, since the lookup revalidates the inode.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name="Reproducer"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Reproducer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two clients A and B, a file with two mirrors in sync:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A opens the file and reads the layout generation with &lt;tt&gt;fgetxattr()&lt;/tt&gt;: 5&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;B writes 4 KiB into the file: generation 6, one mirror stale&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A's &lt;tt&gt;fgetxattr()&lt;/tt&gt; keeps returning 5 for at least 6 s, and 6 right after a &lt;tt&gt;stat()&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name="Cause"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Cause&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;ll_getxattr_lov()&lt;/tt&gt; packs the layout of the client's &lt;tt&gt;cl_object&lt;/tt&gt; with &lt;tt&gt;cl_object_layout_get()&lt;/tt&gt; and never calls &lt;tt&gt;ll_layout_refresh()&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name="Fix"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refresh the layout in getxattr of a regular file before packing it, as I/O does. With a cached layout lock this costs no RPC. Group-locked files are excluded, since a new layout would wait for the group lock’s own I/O (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17620" title="Lustre client gets stuck in lov_layout_wait() awaiting for IO completion" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17620"&gt;LU-17620&lt;/a&gt;). Details and tests are in the patch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Related: &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-14549" title="getxattr for lustre.lov and trusted.lov sometimes wrong after mirror split" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-14549"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-14549&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18553" title="ensure layout refresh before fast read" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18553"&gt;LU-18553&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17620" title="Lustre client gets stuck in lov_layout_wait() awaiting for IO completion" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17620"&gt;LU-17620&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
